Key Conclusion/Resolution:
The team will first determine whether a preferred internal environment, including Dev Enclave, can be used. If access cannot be arranged promptly, the team will use an AWS lab for an initial experiment of up to three days. The lab is an interim experimentation environment rather than the continuing POC environment.
Responsibility and Actions/Follow-up Actions:
