Workshop materials and sample options will be shared for selection.
The team will determine whether additional three-day lab periods can be requested if the initial experiment is insufficient.
Each new lab setup will start without preserving completed work from a previous session.
The team will use automation or pre-canned vector data where possible to reduce repeated initialization.
